        "body": "<p>We've delivered team-building workshops for Four Seasons Hotel Hampshire, The Macallan Whisky (10 bikes in a single day), Hilton Bankside, and GM Motors in Zurich. In December 2024, a corporate team built bamboo balance bikes at our workshop — then donated them to Upcycle, a cycling charity in Brixton.</p><p>Our mobile workshop comes to you. Hotel venues. Corporate offices. Across Europe. Every bike built teaches something real about craft, precision, and sustainable materials.</p>",
