            "text": "<p>In October 2024, Manish — founder of a sustainable AI company and BBC workshop participant — independently calculated the full lifecycle carbon footprint of a BBC bamboo bike. His finding: <strong>the frame is carbon negative.</strong> Bamboo sequesters more carbon during growth than is emitted across the entire manufacturing and assembly process.</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/impact/manish-bamboo-bikes-have-a-negative-carbon-footprint\">Read the full analysis →</a></p>"
